    intendedDifficulty: Authoring sandbox / medium
    routeConcept: Shared endpoints split into high and low routes around a protected
      center pocket.
    towerRoleOpportunities:
    - Long-range coverage across the fork
    - Splash coverage near the shared goal
    dominantThreat: Simultaneous pressure from routes with different curvature.
    ultimateOpportunities: Map-scale control is strongest near the fork and shared
